cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  If you use this software in your research, education, or competition submission,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "TDSF-Linux Desktop"
abstract: |
  TDSF-Linux Desktop is a human-machine collaborative trusted-decision desktop
  assistant for Linux operations. It combines an SSH terminal, AI assistance
  (multi-provider LLM), high-risk command interception, log analysis, and
  paper-supported credibility assessment (D-S evidence theory + PCR5 fusion)
  into a unified Electron application. The project targets Linux operations
  learners and beginners, lowering the learning barrier to zero.

  This project is submitted to 2026 Volcano Cup competition, theme: Educational
  Technology.
type: software
